/**
 * Pokémon Lexicon — Traditional Chinese labels + type chart for detail pages
 *
 * Enum values in pokemon_data.json are English slugs (PokeAPI convention).
 * This module resolves them to official-style 繁體中文 labels.
 * genus translations are generated by scripts/extract_genus_zh.py
 * the type chart is generated by scripts/extract_type_chart.py
 */

